about pointers:

i is used to remove elements to make window size k again
j is used to add new elements
as we put new j into ans, we remove from i
---------------------------------------
1) used when doing with pointers and while loop

j - i + 1

2) for loop method, without pointers

currentSum = currentSum - arr[i - k] + arr[i];

0,1,2,3,4,5,6
so if,
window size = 3 and i is at 4th index
so, currentSum = 2,3,4, now, for next iteration when i becomes 5:-
currentSum = currentSum - arr[5-3] + arr[5]
