Now flow of all sliding window questions, like, how to slide window and get ans

1) first while loop takes e to k + 1
2) so, we have skimmed through first window and have first answer, so update the ans
3) now we enter second while loop
take e into window, remove s from window (note, e and s still point to these elements, we just
took element at e into consideration and removed element at s from consideration,
this made the window size k,
eg: 0(s), 1, 2, 3(e), 4, 5 => s=0 and e=3 window size =3 (0-1-2)
above is the situation after 1st while loop
now, in 2nd while loop, we take 3 and remove 0, so window size is 3 => 1-2-3
now we update answer and increment s and e => 1(s) and 4(e)
continue this till e can be taken
think of last iteration...
0,1,2(s),3,4,5(e)
e < n so enter loop
take 5 remove 2 -> 3-4-5
update ans and increment s and e
so now we are out of index so stop



